  "title": "Q100 문제 풀이 · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "An application spans multiple AZs, but a proposal requires a server in AZ B to directly mount one EBS volume in AZ A without changes. What is the flaw?",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>문제 풀이</span></nav><section class=\"quiz-page\"><div class=\"quiz-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">QUESTION 100</p><h1>문제 풀이</h1></div><strong>100 / 108</strong></div><div class=\"quiz-progress\" aria-label=\"100번째 문제\"><span style=\"width:93%\"></span></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q100\" data-question=\"Q100\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q100</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An application spans multiple AZs, but a proposal requires a server in AZ B to directly mount one EBS volume in AZ A without changes. What is the flaw?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q100\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Backups can be stored only in S3</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q100\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">CloudFront is missing</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q100\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An EBS volume must be in the same AZ as the EC2 instance it attaches to</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q100\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Route 53 is required</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>를 넘는 공유 파일 접근은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/efs/\">EFS</a> 같은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">리전</a>형 파일 시스템을 고려하고 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/\">EBS</a> 데이터는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/snapshot/\">스냅샷</a> 복원 등으로 이동한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/\">EBS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/efs/\">EFS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/snapshot/\">EBS Snapshot</a></div></article><nav class=\"sequence\" aria-label=\"문제 이동\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q099/\">이전 문제 <b>Q099</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q101/\">다음 문제 <b>Q101</b></a></span></nav><p class=\"save-note\">선택과 채점 결과는 이 브라우저에 자동 저장됩니다.</p></section>"
}
